#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:5 e25918dda6c442f687987efcf8e106e0
msgid "Release Procedures"
msgstr "发布流程"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:7 a101b21784204b3ca4f0d9b2160dfe1d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is very reliable because bug fixes are prioritised over new "
"features and releases are performed carefully and only after sufficient "
"testing has been completed."
msgstr "ArduPilot 非常可靠，因为缺陷修复优先于新功能开发，且发布经过充分测试后才会谨慎进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:9 34c306d927e446ed952355572b91751a
msgid ""
"This page outlines the steps that are normally followed for a new release.  "
"Listed mostly as a reference so that we don't forget the steps."
msgstr "本页概述了新版本发布通常遵循的步骤，主要作为参考，以防遗漏。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:12
#: 700707a543dd42c0955d85ead6f8d99b
msgid "Alpha Testing"
msgstr "Alpha 测试"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:14
#: dfabda18d8654b06bf417ff53cbb13ad
msgid ""
"The `AutoTester <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ runs after each commit "
"and highlights issues that it has been setup to test."
msgstr ""
"`自动化测试器 <https://autotest.ardupilot.org/>`__ 在每次提交后运行，并突出显示其所设置测试中发现的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:17
#: 42ae355289264d60988344e202cce729
msgid ""
"Developers and some Alpha testers perform intermittent tests of master "
"especially after new features have been added."
msgstr "开发者和部分 Alpha 测试人员会不定期对 master 分支进行测试，尤其是在新功能添加之后。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:21
#: 3e6578f6114140f4bc308bd760b2bc1a
msgid "Releasing Beta Versions / Release Candidates"
msgstr "发布 Beta 版本/候选发布版"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:23
#: a3df5873cb3943cb92a540a520eeb4db
msgid ""
"Beta Testing / Release candidates are made available to beta testers through"
" the mission planner's \"Beta firmwares\" link.  The Mission Planner \"Beta "
"firmware\" link pulls the firmware from the `beta directories of "
"firmware.ardupilot.org. <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/beta/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Beta 测试/候选发布版通过 Mission Planner 的 \"Beta firmwares\" 链接提供给 Beta 测试人员。Mission"
" Planner 的 \"Beta firmware\" 链接从 `firmware.ardupilot.org 的 beta 目录 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/beta/>`__ 拉取固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:30
#: 935cbdf0b71b436291339b9976c24c87
msgid ""
"Someone with ardupilot GitHub commit access (normally Randy) makes the new "
"firmware available through the following steps:"
msgstr "拥有 ardupilot GitHub 提交权限的人员（通常是 Randy）按以下步骤发布新固件："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:33
#: f4ed0f8abcfa4c3f82cfc24296bf9b17
msgid "For major releases create a new branch"
msgstr "对于主要版本发布，创建一个新分支"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:35
#: 7ed8bc60de7441759238dd866e983d67
msgid "Open a Git Bash terminal in the ardupilot repository."
msgstr "在 ardupilot 仓库中打开 Git Bash 终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:37
#: 332123f01c504fed8f75e07702cd61f9
msgid ""
"For major releases (e.g 4.6 to 4.7) create a new branch in the ardupilot "
"repository based on master:"
msgstr "对于主要版本发布（例如 4.6 升至 4.7），在 ardupilot 仓库中基于 master 创建新分支："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:39
#: 55496798e7394d4b882f1bfc16bcefdb
msgid ""
"``git checkout -b ArduPilot-4.7`` (\"ArduPilot-4.7\" should be replaced with"
" the correct major version number)"
msgstr "``git checkout -b ArduPilot-4.7`` （\"ArduPilot-4.7\" 应替换为正确的主版本号）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:40
#: 6fe47cdcef2648948274404d5c89bc35
msgid "``git push`` to create the new directory in the ardupilot repo"
msgstr "``git push`` 以在 ardupilot 仓库中创建新目录"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:41
#: d446ab96429a4affbb837d1760b37780
msgid ""
"On GitHub ensure the new branch is protected under the `Branch protection "
"rules <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/settings/branches>`__"
msgstr ""
"在 GitHub 上确保新分支受 `分支保护规则 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/settings/branches>`__ 保护"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:42
#: f2de424380004f4ab22a351c4cab96e5
msgid ""
"On the `GitHub projects "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?query=is%3Aopen>`__ page, "
"push the \"New Project\" button and create a new \"4.x Backports\" project."
"  This is used to track features to be included in this release"
msgstr ""
"在 `GitHub 项目 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/projects?query=is%3Aopen>`__ 页面点击 "
"\"New Project\" 按钮，创建新的 \"4.x Backports\" 项目。该项目用于跟踪本次发布要包含的功能"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:43
#: efef63d34d7a491d969fee0ea630f5fd
msgid ""
"Create a new `GitHub issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ for issue tracking (e.g. "
"`ArduPilot 4.7 Issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/32385>`__)"
msgstr ""
"创建一个新的 `GitHub issue <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ "
"用于问题跟踪（例如 `ArduPilot 4.7 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/32385>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:46
#: cad6a256addd41469e6d863705d19172
msgid "Create a Release Pull Request"
msgstr "创建发布 Pull Request"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:48
#: 04c8bdc8943b486e96475b370aa22141
msgid ""
"In your local repo, create a new branch based on the upstream release "
"branch:"
msgstr "在本地仓库中，基于上游发布分支创建一个新分支："

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:50
#: e09c230565d84991a961551910428322
msgid ""
"``git checkout upstream/ArduPilot-4.7`` (\"ArduPilot-4.7\" should be "
"replaced with the correct major version number)"
msgstr "``git checkout upstream/ArduPilot-4.7`` （\"ArduPilot-4.7\" 应替换为正确的主版本号）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:51
#: a2b5e35e37644c81a9102b0fcfc29bdf
msgid ""
"``git checkout -b ap-470-xxx`` to create a new branch for the release PR"
msgstr "``git checkout -b ap-470-xxx`` 为发布 PR 创建一个新分支"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:53
#: 611fb129647e4c43857b10b577bb897d
msgid ""
"Check the `Backports Projects "
"<https://github.com/orgs/ArduPilot/projects>`__ to determine which PRs "
"should be included in this release. For example the `4.7 Backports "
"<https://github.com/orgs/ArduPilot/projects/25/views/2>`__ \"pending\" "
"column holds the list of PRs that should be included in the next "
"ArduPilot-4.7 release."
msgstr ""
"查看 `Backports 项目 <https://github.com/orgs/ArduPilot/projects>`__ 以确定哪些 PR "
"应包含在此次发布中。例如，`4.7 Backports "
"<https://github.com/orgs/ArduPilot/projects/25/views/2>`__ 的 \"pending\" "
"列包含下一个 ArduPilot-4.7 版本应包含的 PR 列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:54
#: db88ce484d214018908fad23fcb41e07
msgid "Create a new column in the project for this release (e.g. 4.7.1-beta1)"
msgstr "在项目中为此版本创建一个新列（例如 4.7.1-beta1）"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:56
#: c011dd919153421a9570072f45e5419f
msgid ""
"use ``gitk upstream/master`` to cherry-pick in each PR's commits from master"
msgstr "使用 ``gitk upstream/master`` 从 master 中 cherry-pick 每个 PR 的提交"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:58
#: 1582e62ad3bc40c8829213aaaa4b2ba2
msgid ""
"As PRs are included in the new branch, move the PR from the \"No Status\" or"
" \"Pending\" column of the project to the column for this release"
msgstr "当 PR 被合入新分支后，将该 PR 从项目的 \"No Status\" 或 \"Pending\" 列移动到此版本对应的列"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:60
#: 9030cd9fd67b415599daa37d33ebd0b5
msgid "Update version, release notes and tags"
msgstr "更新版本号、发布说明和标签"

#: ../../source/docs/release-procedures.rst:62
#: 27e94acf30d0491bbf3f95993574eb88
msgid ""
"update the THISFIRMWARE and FIRMWARE_VERSION definitions in `version.h "
